BT 1 0 0 1 0 64.5 Tm /F3 10.5 Tf 15 TL (I created a Python package named foss-geometry-toolkit for 2D geometric calculations and hosted it in my) Tj T* (College repository on GitHub. I first staged, committed, and pushed an initial version providing rectangle area) Tj T* (and perimeter calculations \(version 0.1.0\). I then checked out the calculation source file from HEAD,) Tj T* (implemented circle area and circumference computations, updated the public module exports and example) Tj T* (script, bumped the package version to 0.2.0, and committed and pushed the updated package.) Tj T* ET
